  "7511192168112336896": {
   "created": 1790807764,
   "author": "Max Sapo",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/maxsapo_project-suncatcher-activity-7511192168112336896-IhN2",
   "text": "Happy to announce that a few months ago, I returned to Google to lead product efforts optimizing our state-of-the-art TPU infrastructure\u2014built to power the next generation of frontier AI (both on Earth and in space).\n\nWhen I joined Google in 2019, I focused on our 0\u21921 commercial & product Cloud TPU strategy. During my time away at Etched and co-founding Happyverse (where I continue to serve as Chairman of the Board), the TPU team achieved an incredible 1\u219210 leap.\n\nNow we\u2019re entering the 10\u2192100+ phase of scale and performance, and I couldn\u2019t be more excited for what lies ahead for our team and the ecosystem.\nGo #TPU \ud83d\ude80",
