  "7511409723405926401": {
   "created": 1790859633,
   "author": "Tim Carden",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/timjcarden_ai-chip-startups-raised-15b-to-take-on-activity-7511409723405926401-XwuW",
   "text": "AI chip startups raised $15B+ to take on Nvidia. Only 3 of the 13 disclose revenue.\nTogether they earn less in a year than Nvidia makes in a week.\nHere's 13 AI chip startups, money raised vs real revenue:\n\n1. Cerebras. $2.85B raised pre-IPO. $720M run rate, Q2 2026 GAAP times 4.\n2. Groq. $2.7B+ raised. Not disclosed. Licensed its tech to Nvidia for ~$20B.\n3. SambaNova. ~$2.5B raised. Not disclosed. $11B valuation in July.\n4. Etched. ~$1.9B raised. Not disclosed. $21B valuation, first rack shipped in July.\n5. Tenstorrent. $1B+ raised. Not disclosed. $2.6B valuation.\n6. Lightmatter. $850M raised. Not disclosed. $4.4B valuation.\n7. Rebellions. $850M raised. ~$22M revenue, 2025 audited. IPO plan",
   "disc_score": 5,
